DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nSeattle Turkish Film Festival W
 inner of Best Actress (Istanbul Film Festival)\, nominated for a Golden Ga
 te Award (San Francisco International Film Festival) and Golden Tulip for 
